      "text": "cards are discarded back to the\nappropriate auction deck \n\nsome cards are discarded after\nusing operation ability\n\nmost cards are discarded after\nusing combat ability\n\nsome cards are never discarded\n(most \"basic\" cards)\n\nprevious passive cards are\ndiscarded when a new passive card\nis placed",
